  "title": "Crypto-Agility Readiness Scorer",
  "description": "Score your organisation's crypto-agility maturity across 8 control dimensions (0–5 each, 40 max): inventory, tooling, policy, testing, vendor, governance, monitoring, and incident response. Returns overall maturity level (Level 1–5), per-dimension gap analysis, prioritised recommendations, and a compliance_control Policy Mandate. Final step in the PQC Migration chain.",
